# A dense switch whose cases do different work is one indirect jump. A value outside the cases becomes the row of the default, the table holds a 32-bit offset per row,
# and the target is the address of the table plus that offset. The first patchpoint is the address of the table and the last one is the jump.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="apply" role=Source
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#0:
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[isDefault]] = AboveEqual(b@[[operation]], $8(
# CHECK-NEXT: Int32 b@[[row]] = Select(b@[[isDefault]], $8(b@{{*}}), b@[[operation]])
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[wideRow]] = ZExt32(b@[[row]])
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[table]] = Patchpoint(runsWithoutFrame, resultConstraints = SomeRegister)
# CHECK: Int64 b@[[scaledRow]] = Shl(b@[[wideRow]], $2(
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[entry]] = Add(b@[[scaledRow]], b@[[table]])
# CHECK-NEXT: Int32 b@[[offset]] = Load(b@[[entry]], ReadsImmutable
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[wideOffset]] = SExt32(b@[[offset]])
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[target]] = Add(b@[[wideOffset]], b@[[table]])
# CHECK: Patchpoint<CloningForbidden>(b@[[target]]:SomeRegister, runsWithoutFrame, resultConstraints = WarmAny, Terminal)
# CHECK-NEXT: Successors: #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}, #{{*}}
# CHECK-LABEL: end of function
# No case is found by a comparison.
# NONE-LABEL: name="apply" role=Source
# NONE-NOT: Branch(
# NONE-NOT: Switch(
# NONE-NOT:  = Equal(
# NONE-LABEL: end of function
# The dispatch is five instructions and the two patchpoints. The rest are the nine arms.
# X64: instructions: 26, patchpoints: 2
# ARM64: instructions: 22, patchpoints: 2
